          "guid": "mt310ts71tv5gh8o",
          "message": {
            "text": "The oracle separates CoreText provenance from name-based reconstruction by recording the live fallback object first, then reopening that exact answer through PostScript, display-name, and explicit weight-400 descriptor arms. Repeating the matrix in fresh and warm processes makes runner-local state visible instead of inferring it from CDP face names.",
            "markdown": "The oracle separates CoreText provenance from name-based reconstruction by recording the live fallback object first, then reopening that exact answer through PostScript, display-name, and explicit weight-400 descriptor arms. Repeating the matrix in fresh and warm processes makes runner-local state visible instead of inferring it from CDP face names."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/pingfang-live-descriptor.swift"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 53,
                  "endLine": 66,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "\nvar samples: [[String: Any]] = []\nfor iteration in 0..<repeats {\n  let base = CTFontCreateWithName(\"STHeitiSC-Light\" as CFString, 32, nil)\n  for cp in codepoints {\n    let text = scalarString(cp)\n    let live = CTFontCreateForString(base, text as CFString, CFRange(location: 0, length: text.utf16.count))\n    let canonical = CTFontCreateWithName(CTFontCopyPostScriptName(live), 32, nil)\n    let display = CTFontCreateWithName(CTFontCopyDisplayName(live), 32, nil)\n    let weightedDescriptor = CTFontDescriptorCreateCopyWithAttributes(CTFontCopyFontDescriptor(live), [kCTFontTraitsAttribute: [kCTFontWeightTrait: 0.0]] as CFDictionary)\n    let explicit400 = CTFontCreateWithFontDescriptor(weightedDescriptor, 32, nil)\n    samples.append([\"iteration\": iteration, \"queryCodepoint\": cp, \"arms\": [\n      fontRecord(live, \"live-fallback\"), fontRecord(canonical, \"canonical-postscript\"),\n      fontRecord(display, \"display-name\"), fontRecord(explicit400, \"explicit-wght-400\")"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ],
            "ext-ai-tool-confidence": 0.97
          },
